    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8fb5c84c",
      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The woman in traditional attire is mapped as 'ma'am'",
      "description": "The text 'it's ma'am!!' in the top image explicitly labels the woman in traditional attire as 'ma'am', establishing an analogical mapping where the textual entity 'ma'am' is projected onto the visual entity 'woman_top'. This mapping is reinforced by the formal context and the woman's dignified expression, aligning with the gendered language stereotype where 'ma'am' denotes respect for a woman.",
